    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics isn’t something I’ve deeply explored beyond basic algebra and geometry. I’m not afraid of it, but I don’t find it fascinating. I enjoy reading about its history and how it’s used in real-life applications, but I don’t have a strong emotional link to it. It’s more of a functional skill than a passion.",
