    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I used AI a few times to check my answers and to get quick explanations. It was helpful, especially when I was trying to understand a concept. It didn’t replace my own thinking, but it gave me new angles. I found it particularly useful for solving problems when I was stuck.",
