    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting to each student’s pace and style. They can offer immediate feedback, explain concepts in different ways, and generate practice problems. This can help students build confidence and reduce anxiety. Used well, they can support a more engaging and inclusive learning environment."
